{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300aLeap Tactics\u300b</strong><br>A pixel-art platform puzzle game where <strong>all mechanisms are controlled by your jumps</strong>. Combine jumping actions with interactive mechanics to cleverly unravel the path to the goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Mechanics</strong><br>Your character has a <strong>unique activation zone</strong>. If this zone overlaps with a mechanism <i>while jumping</i>, the mechanism's state will toggle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/\u6838\u5fc3\u73a9\u6cd5\u5c55\u793a.gif?t=1745448616\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mechanism Examples</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blocks that appear/disappear after jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/\u7816\u5757.gif?t=1745448616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Claws that switch between ascending/descending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/\u5347\u964d\u722a.gif?t=1745448616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spiked blocks rotating clockwise post-jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/\u523a\u7816.gif?t=1745448616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ladders extending/retracting with jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/\u68af\u5b50.gif?t=1745448616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A companion that jumps in sync with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/\u8df3\u8dc3.gif?t=1745448616\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Worried about platforming difficulty?</strong><br>Fear not! The game minimizes precise platforming demands. With an undo function, you can undo any jump instantly, focusing purely on puzzle-solving. Accessible even to platforming novices.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/\u64a4\u9500.gif?t=1745448616\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Content Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ jump-activated mechanisms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80+ handcrafted levels with a gentle difficulty curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden challenge levels (with hints) for hardcore players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easter egg stages scattered in the game world</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549150?t=1745448616","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549150?t=1745448616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/7c8020b1441f52b19280e2e10e00a24940f53c21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745448616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/7c8020b1441f52b19280e2e10e00a24940f53c21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745448616","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3683720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300aLeap Tactics\u300b</strong><br>A pixel-art platform puzzle game where <strong>all mechanisms are controlled by your jumps</strong>. Combine jumping actions with interactive mechanics to cleverly unravel the path to the goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>C